ncjach World Cube Association. Po niezwykle udanej edycji 2021 Mistrzostwa Polski ponownie zostaną przeprowadzone w miejscu wyjątkowym jakim jest Olivia Star! Poraz kolejny rywalizacji na najwyższym poziomie będą towarzyszyły niesamowite widoki 34 piętra Olivia Star - największego wieżowca w północnej Polsce! --- Polish Speedcubing Championship is the most important event of the year of every Polish speedcuber. Since 2005 it continues to attract best competitors who compete for national titles in all events sanctioned by World Cube Association. After successful 2021 edition this year's championship will be held in a special place - Olivia Star! Once again competing at the highest level will be accompanied by amazing views from 34th floor of Olivia Star building - highest scyscraper in northern Poland!","externalWebsite":"https://zawody.rubiart.pl/competitions/23","region":"PL"},{"id":"PolishChampionship2021","name":"Polish Championship 2021","city":"Gdańsk","country":"PL","date":{"from":"2021-10-01","till":"2021-10-03","numberOfDays":3},"isCanceled":false,"events":["222","333","333bf","333fm","333mbf","333oh","444","444bf","555","555bf","666","777","clock","minx","pyram","skewb","sq1"],"wcaDelegates":[{"name":"Adam Polkowski","email":"polkowski.a.j@gmail.com"},{"name":"Grzegorz Łuczyna","email":"gluczyna@worldcubeassociation.org"},{"name":"Piotr Trząski","email":"trzaskipiotr@gmail.com"},{"name":"Przemysław Rogalski","email":"progalski@worldcubeassociation.org"}],"organisers":[{"name":"Adam Polkowski","email":"polkowski.a.j@gmail.com"},{"name":"Karolina Wiącek","email":"karola.wiacek@gmail.com"}],"venue":{"name":"[Olivia TOP Star](https://www.oliviastar.pl/)","address":"Aleja Grunwaldzka 472, 80-309 Gdańsk","details":"34th floor","coordinates":{"latitude":54.402768,"longitude":18.571521}},"information":"Prosimy o zapoznanie się z zawartością zakładki COVID-19 --- Please read COVID-19 tab.","externalWebsite":"https://zawody.rubiart.pl/competitions/15","region":"PL"},